        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "03fa16e0-8c37-37fe-9b99-498772d7e973",
                "word": "futurologue",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9d2b3a1c-3bc0-4694-86b4-dd34fb6b8693",
                        "entry_id": "03fa16e0-8c37-37fe-9b99-498772d7e973",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "futurologues"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b0a24b92-4c3c-3582-aa91-4bf92c5dff88",
                        "entry_id": "03fa16e0-8c37-37fe-9b99-498772d7e973",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Spécialiste dans l’observation des changements qui s’amorcent et la prédiction des événements à venir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d148d32-cfa1-49c0-a569-99eceb9304c4",
                                "sense_id": "b0a24b92-4c3c-3582-aa91-4bf92c5dff88",
                                "text": "Le futurologue est obligé, au moins dans certaines de ses hypothèses, de tenir compte des tendances du passé."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46870c29-af81-4d91-808b-c5554d6be252",
                                "sense_id": "b0a24b92-4c3c-3582-aa91-4bf92c5dff88",
                                "text": "Il y a quelques années, le futurologue et directeur de l’ingénierie chez Google Raymond Kurzweil affirmait par exemple que nos méninges seraient directement connectées à Internet d’ici 2030."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dcfd5406-a2bb-4a16-8388-c3323e516342",
                        "source_entry_id": "03fa16e0-8c37-37fe-9b99-498772d7e973",
                        "source_sense_id": "b0a24b92-4c3c-3582-aa91-4bf92c5dff88",
                        "target_lang_word": "Futurologe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Futurologe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84f5c685-e41c-38d6-a77d-38d8d79a1ec7",
                                        "entry_id": "d54d868d-986f-3c11-aa93-deb4d6c66eb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wissenschaftler, der mit wissenschaftlichen Methoden versucht, die Zukunft so gut wie möglich vorherzusagen; eine Person, die sich (beruflich) mit Futurologie beschäftigt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0aa3569-2333-4dff-9d8b-0e874c5c3d32",
                                                "sense_id": "84f5c685-e41c-38d6-a77d-38d8d79a1ec7",
                                                "text": "Die Futurologen trafen sich zu einem Kongress."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "23ae606a-cb2b-4f26-9be0-4e7ee61e5853",
                        "source_entry_id": "03fa16e0-8c37-37fe-9b99-498772d7e973",
                        "source_sense_id": "b0a24b92-4c3c-3582-aa91-4bf92c5dff88",
                        "target_lang_word": "futurist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "futurist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e991570-a379-3bab-8ce5-34ddee45de6e",
                                        "entry_id": "5677da87-72ed-3e75-ad2d-a142231b04df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An adherent to the principles of the artistic movement of futurism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c5d1d8b-3a56-463f-886a-4bf4e599dc3e",
                                                "sense_id": "1e991570-a379-3bab-8ce5-34ddee45de6e",
                                                "text": "The distinction, however, seems to be that the warriors of the past went in for tournaments, which were at least dangerous for themselves, while the Futurists go in for motor-cars, which are mainly alarming for other people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b444230-f3ad-425b-a7c7-5016f2e61dcf",
                                                "sense_id": "1e991570-a379-3bab-8ce5-34ddee45de6e",
                                                "text": "‘A passion for destruction is also a creative passion.’ This statement by the Russian revolutionary Mikhail Bakunin in 1842 could have been the rallying cry of the Italian Futurists around 1910."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ada8045f-53ef-3722-8aa1-8b1db3db5efb",
                                        "entry_id": "5677da87-72ed-3e75-ad2d-a142231b04df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who studies and predicts possible futures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce35741b-bb4b-4db1-903a-cdd83067b6d8",
                                                "sense_id": "ada8045f-53ef-3722-8aa1-8b1db3db5efb",
                                                "text": "Two multibillion-dollar industries—the computer manufacturers and telephone companies—had each developed its technologies separately. But as futurist Howard Rheingold suggests in his book Virtual Communities, the industries inadvertently gave private consumers access to those billion of dollars by selling them a tiny device to link the two technologies together: a computer modem."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "futurist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dea49d1e-f7ab-3612-a536-9c06a3197804",
                                        "entry_id": "6171ce71-f023-3e8f-9b5f-d86c7875c176",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In the style of futurism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "065d6a12-011a-40b7-83c1-5093cb82c892",
                                                "sense_id": "dea49d1e-f7ab-3612-a536-9c06a3197804",
                                                "text": "Salvat took to heart what Marinetti was provocatively clamoring: “Futurist poetry, having already destroyed traditional metrics and created free verse, now destroys the Latin period and its syntax. Futurist poetry is a spontaneous uninterrupted flow of analogies, each synthesized in an essential noun”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "932846ed-c0c9-4cab-b59c-be19b7357466",
                        "source_entry_id": "03fa16e0-8c37-37fe-9b99-498772d7e973",
                        "source_sense_id": "b0a24b92-4c3c-3582-aa91-4bf92c5dff88",
                        "target_lang_word": "futurologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "futurologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6e3d0c0-2f3f-3416-8b14-06b78ebaee67",
                                        "entry_id": "471910dd-dff3-3483-9566-179a938d9e7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who practices futurology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c5d8c75-418d-48eb-811a-ccd16aad0e92",
                                                "sense_id": "f6e3d0c0-2f3f-3416-8b14-06b78ebaee67",
                                                "text": "Although I do not pretend to be a futurologist, I would be embarrassed if my view of the trends and causes of social life in the United States had become invalid in such a short interval. (It is easy to be a success as a futurologist as long as your predictions are about what's going to happen fifty years ahead. No one can prove you wrong until fifty years go by. […])"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4300ee2b-d327-4fdd-a540-5e72d7f2ecab",
                        "source_entry_id": "03fa16e0-8c37-37fe-9b99-498772d7e973",
